window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>I wasn't looking to fall for one man. Let alone two...</i></p> <p>Sullivan and Will are as close as two friends can be. Growing up in the system forced them to rely on each other, and they've become accustomed to sharing everything - including women.</p> <p>Now they're ready for more. To find love. To start a family. To see the dreams they've shared since childhood come true.</p> <p>Apparently I tick off every box on their list - brains, beauty, and sass. I never hesitate to put both men in their places - which they find sexy as hell.</p> <p>One problem, I'm a traditional girl, with traditional values - one man, one woman, till death do us part - kind of values.</p> <p>They're willing to work to prove how very right the three of us could be, but what happens next is anyone's guess....</p>"; 
